kernel-might-not-be/","publishedAt","2026-11-02T18:35:06.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/2a60025a8fe0e259.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/b6e385a4a43a2c31.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/2a60025a8fe0e259.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"followUp","shfnqqty603i8l19g63b43gpl","EDK II PXE 驱动漏洞 CVE-2026-97631 允许启动前执行代码","EDK II 的 PXE 网络启动驱动存在 CVE-2026-97631，CVSS 4.0 评分 9.5；攻击者可在 Secure Boot 和度量启动校验前触发越界写入，在操作系统加载前执行代码或造成拒绝服务。","安全客","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5ODA0NDE2MA==&mid=2649790661&idx=1&sn=1385c2dfcbcaf38e00737143ad75a02d","2026-11-02T00:30:00.000Z","n1pma2heqqc1u393qm8xxm48n","Synology警告C3RB3R勒索软件利用旧版DSM漏洞攻击NAS设备","Synology确认攻击者正利用2024年12月已修复的漏洞，针对运行过时DSM版本的NAS设备实施C3RB3R勒索攻击。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/synology-warns-customers-of-ongoing-c3rb3r-ransomware-attacks/","2026-11-02T11:28:42.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w",{"_114":181,"_80":-5,"_116":182},{"_114":145,"_80":-5,"_116":146},{"_114":115,"_80":-5,"_116":117},"label","AI 安全","items",[118,119,120],{"_77":137,"_33":138,"_80":139,"_82":140,"_84":141,"_86":142,"_88":143,"_90":144,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_77":129,"_33":130,"_80":131,"_82":132,"_84":133,"_86":134,"_88":135,"_90":136,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_77":121,"_33":122,"_80":123,"_82":124,"_84":125,"_86":126,"_88":127,"_90":128,"_92":93,"_94":95},"teaxhs6mgmqr7we21mxnq1hmt","Trail of Bits 使用 Codex 批量回移 Linux 安全修复，已覆盖 149 个 CVE","Trail of Bits 使用 Codex 与 GPT-5.6 协助将安全修复回移到 Linux 稳定分支及 Ubuntu、Fedora 等软件包。","Trail of Bits","https://blog.trailofbits.com/2026/11/02/backporting-security-fixes-at-scale-with-codex/","2026-11-02T12:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/9215b9af5123c7ea.webp","/dailyinfo/media/5acd642ecf79fa1f.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/9215b9af5123c7ea.webp 96w","o24ucbtgopfr2yuihm7llam2f","LocalAlign 通过近目标对抗训练提升大语言模型提示注入防御泛化能力","LocalAlign 通过近目标对抗样本生成与 Margin-Aware Alignment 提升大语言模型的提示注入防御泛化能力，防御能力写入模型参数，推理时无需额外调用攻击检测模型。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95243","2026-11-01T07:38:37.395Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","k8iee38q6sr0000yquvlj925i","Google Cloud 披露 LLMJacking 攻击链，攻击者转售被盗企业 LLM 资源","Google Cloud 威胁情报披露，攻击者在 2026 年多起 LLMJacking 入侵中盗用企业云身份和 LLM API 凭据，入侵北美、南美及亚太的金融、零售、技术和运输组织，单日欺诈费用超过 $100,000 USD，部分组织累计达 $1 million USD。","Google Cloud 威胁情报","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/llmjacking-monetizing-compromised-cloud-models/","2026-11-02T14:00:00.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9a88f7a6491d815b.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/424bd6373c2d87d6.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[147,148,149,150,151],{"_77":46,"_33":39,"_80":179,"_82":140,"_84":180,"_86":142,"_88":143,"_90":144,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_178":30},{"_77":173,"_33":174,"_80":175,"_82":106,"_84":176,"_86":177,"_88":109,"_90":110,"_92":93,"_94":95,"_178":26},{"_77":165,"_33":166,"_80":167,"_82":168,"_84":169,"_86":170,"_88":171,"_90":172,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_77":160,"_33":161,"_80":162,"_82":106,"_84":163,"_86":164,"_88":109,"_90":110,"_92":93,"_94":95},{"_77":152,"_33":153,"_80":154,"_82":155,"_84":156,"_86":157,"_88":158,"_90":159,"_92":93,"_94":95},"zpp06qhnjm5r6ekq6fx53gr5s","攻击者向乌克兰和俄罗斯民众发送虚假核威胁与袭击警报","乌克兰和俄罗斯的应急警报应用疑遭网络攻击，向民众发送核威胁、辐射、化学攻击和巷战等虚假警报，相关说法尚未获独立证实。乌克兰 Air Alarm 应用于当地时间 22:47 起发出多条警报，部分警报还触发 Lviv 地区广播；该应用随后因疑似被攻破而临时停用。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202248/security/hackers-send-fake-nuclear-threat-alerts-to-ukrainian-and-russian-citizens.html","2026-11-02T10:20:46.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","y3oqogzfuz08thepvfa99u3bx","BTCPay Server 旧版本实例遭遇热钱包盗取，2.4.1及更早版本需升级至2.4.7","BTCPay Server 维护者称，黑客已针对运行 2.4.1（2026年7月23日）或更早版本的实例盗取热钱包资金，攻击未针对公开服务器。项目建议受影响实例尽快下线并升级至 2.4.7；原文称尚无使用 2.4.7 的热钱包盗取可信报告，但近期攻击具体利用的漏洞尚未查明，受影响用户需向 security@btcpayserver.org 提交活动日志。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/btcpay-server-warns-of-hot-wallet-thefts-targeting-outdated-instances/","2026-11-02T15:03:07.000Z","t0wff82r3vhco60wkrm3qmm96","攻击者伪装 Microsoft Teams IT 支持，利用不安全 AD CS 窃取企业数据","Microsoft 调查了两起攻击者伪装 IT 支持并诱导员工通过 Microsoft Teams 使用 Quick Assist 授予远程控制的入侵，攻击者随后利用不安全配置的 AD CS 获取高权限账户及域控制器证书，其中一起将企业数据复制到外部服务器。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/attackers-pose-as-it-support-on.html","2026-11-02T11:08:45.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","c8c3sczng53jdb0j9x5vqc0ry","欧洲多国逾115家超市制冷系统遭攻击，门店被迫处置变质商品","攻击者远程修改欧洲多国超市冷柜和制冷系统的温度设置、关闭制冷设备或启动除霜，导致超过115家门店受到影响，并造成商品损失和提前营业干预。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/hackers-disrupt-refrigeration-systems-at-european-supermarkets/","2026-11-02T14:28:39.000Z","otherSources","Google 与行业伙伴已拆除 XCPE 后门相关控制基础设施，该后门将超过 1.3 million 台机顶盒及其他 Android IoT 设备纳入僵尸网络。","https://cloud.google.com/blog/topics/threat-intelligence/shutting-the-door-on-the-xcpe-botnet/","漏洞与在野利用",[183,184],{"_77":200,"_33":201,"_80":202,"_82":203,"_84":204,"_86":205,"_88":-5,"_92":95,"_94":95,"_178":26},{"_77":185,"_33":186,"_80":187,"_82":188,"_84":189,"_86":190,"_88":191,"_90":192,"_92":95,"_94":95,"_178":28,"_193":194,"_96":29},"tqj4dxtikwan2dwzgf1hpjvys","Ivanti Connect Secure 三个零日漏洞已被链式利用，CVE-2026-111357 与 CVE-2026-118527 纳入 KEV","Ivanti Connect Secure 的 CVE-2026-111357、CVE-2026-118527 与 CVE-2026-104935 已被链式利用，可获取未认证 root 权限并窃取 Windows LAPS 密码和 BitLocker 恢复密钥，UTA0576 自 2026 年 10 月 3 日起攻击运行 22.8R2.4 的设备，影响客户数量有限。","Rapid7 CVE 公告","https://www.rapid7.com/blog/post/etr-additional-ivanti-connect-secure-zero-days-exploited-in-the-wild-cve-2026-111357-cve-2026-118527","2026-11-02T11:04:08.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp","/dailyinfo/media/c16323cf53c574df.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/092fbeae5b5c3123.webp 96w","related",[195],{"_77":196,"_33":197,"_